    "Add AWS auth or mutation commands",
    "Hardcode the live public base URL",
    "Auto-roll back on smoke failure",
    "Bundle smoke automation with rollout or image push logic"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Patch artifact only.",
    "Describes the created read-only workflow shape.",
    "Not a workflow control plane and not an approval token."
  ]
